A dynamic composition in the style of Piet Mondrian featuring a vertical stack of rectangular blocks in primary colors—bold red, yellow, and blue—with thick black lines separating them. The blocks appear to be in motion, some shifting positions and swapping places with others, creating a sense of fluid reorganization. Ghost outlines show where blocks previously resided, suggesting movement and change. The composition transforms from an orderly grid on the left side to a reshuffled arrangement on the right, with subtle arrows formed by negative white space indicating the directional flow of the shifting elements. Clean geometric precision with a subtle sense of kinetic energy, asymmetrical balance, white background.
